WEBVTT

00:00:00.412 --> 00:00:11.613
In this video, you will see how a lighting company gets a profile on SoCal Lights, how homes link to it with Installed by, and how a company claims and manages its own profile.

00:00:11.613 --> 00:00:12.608
We start on the map.

00:00:13.565 --> 00:00:15.239
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:18.064 --> 00:00:20.614
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:22.316 --> 00:00:23.296
Then tap Allow.

00:00:27.142 --> 00:00:28.455
Tap the season button.

00:00:30.681 --> 00:00:32.660
Tap Thanksgiving and Christmas Lights.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.373
Let's look at how a lighting company gets a profile.

00:00:37.373 --> 00:00:40.759
A homeowner can say which company installed their lights.

00:00:40.759 --> 00:00:42.626
Search for a home that does.

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:44.360
Type its name, and open it.

00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:49.614
It says Installed by, with the company's name.

00:00:49.614 --> 00:00:54.829
If there is a check mark next to the name, the company has confirmed that it did the job.

00:00:54.829 --> 00:00:59.624
Without one, the homeowner says it did, but the company has not confirmed it yet.

00:01:00.443 --> 00:01:03.645
Tap the company's name to open its profile page.

00:01:03.645 --> 00:01:06.803
At the bottom, a company can tap Claim this profile.

00:01:08.684 --> 00:01:13.089
If its email is at its website, the profile is its own at once.

00:01:13.089 --> 00:01:16.403
Otherwise the site owner checks it, and emails the company.

00:01:17.279 --> 00:01:22.708
Once the profile is yours, you manage it here, with your company details and logo.

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:25.783
Homes that name your company are listed on the Homes tab.

00:01:26.627 --> 00:01:29.901
Tap Confirm for each home you really installed.

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:36.557
It gets a check mark, which tells visitors it is true, and then you and the homeowner can both edit that listing.

00:01:36.557 --> 00:01:40.939
If it is not yours, tap Not ours, and the name is removed from that home.

00:01:42.828 --> 00:01:45.359
Next up: Sponsor your installer company.
